    "lesson": 1,
    "title": [
        "Judy",
        "朱迪"
    ],
    "content": {
        "sentences": [
            [
                "Judy Hopper is a cute bunny who lives in a beautiful forest with her parents and her brother Peter.",
                "朱迪·霍珀是一只可爱的兔子，她和父母以及弟弟彼得住在美丽的森林里。"
            ],
            [
                "One day, Judy's father, Mr. Hopper received a letter from his older sister.",
                "一天，朱迪的父亲霍珀先生收到了他姐姐的来信。"
            ],
            [
                "\"Dear brother, my daughter Fluffy is getting married in August!",
                "「亲爱的哥哥，我的女儿芙洛菲要在八月结婚了！"
            ],
            [
                "She and your aunt Anna and uncle Steve want Judy and Peter to be the flower girl and page boy.\" Mr. Hopper put on his glasses and read.",
                "她和你的安娜姨妈、史蒂夫姨父希望朱迪和彼得担任女花童和男花童。」霍珀先生戴上眼镜读道。"
            ],
            [
                "\"Yay! I can't wait to go to my cousin's wedding!\" Judy was so happy and jumped high.",
                "「耶！我迫不及待想去参加我表姐的婚礼！」朱迪非常高兴，跳得很高。"
            ],
            [
                "She hadn't seen her grandparents and other family members for a long time.",
                "她很久没见祖父母和其他家庭成员了。"
            ],
            [
                "\"Mummy, can I have a new dress?\" she asked.",
                "「妈咪，我可以有一条新裙子吗？」她问道。"
            ],
            [
                "\"Of course,\" answered her mother cheerfully.",
                "「当然可以，」她的母亲愉快地回答。"
            ],
            [
                "The wedding took place in a white church by a lake.",
                "婚礼在湖边的一座白色教堂举行。"
            ],
            [
                "Judy was in her new pink dress and Peter was in his new smart suit.",
                "朱迪穿着她新的粉色连衣裙，彼得穿着他新的帅气西装。"
            ],
            [
                "Along with music, they walked into the venue with two pretty flower baskets.",
                "伴随着音乐，她们提着两个漂亮的花篮走进会场。"
            ],
            [
                "\"I like your cute dress.\" Grandmother whispered to her granddaughter when she sat down beside her.",
                "「我喜欢你可爱的裙子。」祖母在她身边坐下时低声对孙女说。"
            ],
            [
                "Judy gave Grandmother a big smile.",
                "朱迪给了祖母一个大大的微笑。"
            ],
            [
                "\"I now pronounce you husband and wife,\" said Father Rabbit.",
                "「我现在宣布你们结为夫妻，」兔父说。"
            ],
            [
                "All the guests burst into applause for the couple in love.",
                "所有宾客都为这对相爱的人爆发掌声。"
            ],
            [
                "The family and friends sang and danced happily until the moon and stars came out.",
                "家人和朋友们快乐地唱歌跳舞，直到月亮和星星出来。"
            ],
            [
                "\"I like everyone's smiling and laughing,\" Judy told her father before she fell asleep.",
                "「我喜欢大家的微笑和欢笑，」朱迪在睡前告诉她的父亲。"
            ],
            [
                "Then she had the sweetest dream ever.",
                "然后她做了个最甜美的梦。"
            ]
        ]
    },
